  "details": "When opening VRChat and going to social tab, it will show all friends in alphabetical order. However, if you refesh it, it will break down.\n\nSteps to reproduce\n\n1. Open VRC beta\n\n2. Wait for it to load\n\n3. Go to social tab\n\n4. Refresh tab (pull down and let go)\n\n5. Issue pops up.\n\nDevice info: iPhone 15 Pro Max\n\nOS: iOS 18.1 Dev Beta 5\n\nVideo of issue: https://prism.roitec.fi/share/pLGTFq5BZDj0daf59q07qgo61dDuPhfF9Q8SgOlTG0BppYK0sveAk86nBgvj9S9KFVU/photos/886246b3-6a1d-490d-b2a0-af4ae6b0651a",
